        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Thanks for taking a look at this and sorry for not reading the CONTRIBUTING.md properly.\r\n\r\n I don't really have a argument of having this feature especially if it seems too heavy for what it provides. I just found it being strange that this was missing when it is part of the default completion.\r\n \r\n I guess this can be closed and opened in a new PR if it ever comes relevant in the future.",
