        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "After thinking about it, this does look like a reasonable thing to support. I decided to go with more flexible support and [allow customizing `abbr_hlgroup` as inside `process_items()`](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/256d35c9e24c9cf5f5da568e121e988c6ceb1e3f/doc/mini-completion.txt#L51-L53) (same as for `kind_hlgroup`). By default it [adds new `MiniCompletionDeprected` group](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/256d35c9e24c9cf5f5da568e121e988c6ceb1e3f/doc/mini-completion.txt#L370) for items that are marked as deprecated.\r\n\r\nThanks again for pointing this out!",
